plays the third verse for the second time to give it a little more umph ;)

Note: On bothe the verse's and chorus hammer on to Cadd9 twice from the original C chord
timing with the song and slide your hammer on finger down two frets.  The second Dm
played in the chorus is with G bass string.  I've only been playing three months so just
I've named the chord wrong, the Bbadd9 is where the first fret is barred and you play
middle D and G strings on the third fret.  Anyways, I hope you enjoy, theres more
